      "id": "DC_kwDOKrJqmc4A8xL_",
      "body": "For anyone who may be interested, I just published a blog post on how I got this working on my device. I was able to install Tailscale and have Rayhunter connect to my self hosted ntfy server so I can receive notifications from the device without having to put ntfy on the public internet. You can also access the webUI from any device on your tailnet. Hope this helps!\r\n\r\nhttps://blog.wsmith.io/posts/orbic-and-tailscale/",
      "author": {
        "login": "Smith8154",
        "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10672359?u=09c83b6bfca232ec568623cb39a1e252cd3000af&v=4",
        "url": "https://github.com/Smith8154"
